HTTrack 3.50.4: a new copy is no longer limited to 25 KB/s.

• A new copy now runs at up to 100 KB/s instead of 25 KB/s. A limit you set yourself still applies
• If a site asks you to wait, HTTrack waits and tries again. You can set the longest wait
• Pages that use JavaScript modules are copied more completely
• HTTrack now applies only the robots.txt rules written for it